<title>USA: CMA reports U.S. second quarter 1997 cocoa grind.</title>
<headline>CMA reports U.S. second quarter 1997 cocoa grind.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chocolate Manufacturers</p>
<p>Association reported the following cocoa bean and product usage</p>
<p>figures:</p>
<p>		 2nd Quarter   2nd Quarter  Increase/  Pct Change</p>
<p>		    1997	   1996	 Decrease</p>
<p>Beans Ground   97,223	 82,713	 14,510	17.54</p>
<p>Liquor Melted   1,629	  1,265	    364	28.77</p>
<p>Butter Melted  15,093	 14,157*	   936	 6.61</p>
<p>*Note: CMA revised the total cocoa butter melted for the second quarter of 1996. It was previously reported as 14,121 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
